    "reasoning": "Sierra La Madera is the Sky Island range in the municipios of Cumpas, Granados, Huásabas, Moctezuma and Villa Hidalgo (Bermudez-Enriquez et al. 2013, USDA RMRS-P-67). GeoNames 9028461 lies between those towns: 27 km east of Cumpas and 21 km west of Huásabas on the Bavispe (pipeline/measure/distances.py). The book puts the wolf on its eastern slopes, then across the Bavispe and north, which fits a range bounded on the east by the river. GeoNames 3996948, a closer name match, lies east of the river's upper course and would need no crossing."
